check assertDelegationExpiresAtEmergencyExit_Positive for 5 but 3 State, 5 User, 3 Role, 5 Object, 5 Request
check assertDelegationMinClearance_Positive for 5 but 3 State, 5 User, 3 Role, 5 Object, 5 Request
check assertMultipleEmergencyTransitions_Positive for 5 but 5 State, 5 User, 3 Role, 5 Object, 5 Request

// Negative assertions (expected to be UNSAT unless requirements are relaxed for test)
